---
description: Use Token Ops to reduce wasted Cursor context.
alwaysApply: true
---

Use Token Ops before broad repository exploration.

Call `build_compact_context` for implementation, debugging, review, or test tasks before reading many files. Use its snippets first, then inspect only the smallest extra files needed.

Call `list_high_cost_files` before opening large files, generated files, lockfiles, or long logs.

Call `report_saved_tokens` when the user asks about tokens, cost, usage, or savings.
